WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:27.184
Eddy drove toward his friends.

2
00:00:27.185 --> 00:00:37.910
He felt awful.

3
00:00:37.911 --> 00:00:41.414
Zippy flew past Eddy.

4
00:00:41.415 --> 00:00:44.974
"I made the team!" Zippy shouted.

5
00:00:44.975 --> 00:00:50.429
"And Eddy didn't!"

6
00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:56.942
Poppy looked at Eddy.

7
00:00:56.943 --> 00:01:06.876
She whispered to Dipper and Jeb.

8
00:01:06.877 --> 00:01:09.779
The three of them raced away.

9
00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:12.922
They drove behind the garage.

10
00:01:12.923 --> 00:01:15.794
Eddy gasped.

11
00:01:15.795 --> 00:01:20.588
"My friends don't like me anymore!" he thought.

12
00:01:20.589 --> 00:01:23.596
Eddy grew angry.

13
00:01:23.597 --> 00:01:26.753
"They're mean!" he thought.

14
00:01:26.754 --> 00:01:30.013
"I'll tell them that!"

15
00:01:30.014 --> 00:01:33.251
Eddy drove behind the garage.

16
00:01:33.252 --> 00:01:37.086
"Surprise!" shouted Poppy.

17
00:01:37.087 --> 00:01:39.614
"Huh?" said Eddy.

18
00:01:39.615 --> 00:01:42.884
Poppy stuck a sticker on Eddy.

19
00:01:42.885 --> 00:01:46.139
"There!" she said.

20
00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:49.145
"Now you're on a team!"

21
00:01:49.146 --> 00:01:51.882
"What team?" asked Eddy.

22
00:01:51.883 --> 00:01:55.219
"Our team!" said Dipper.

23
00:01:55.220 --> 00:02:02.069
"It's a friends' team!" said Jeb.

24
00:02:02.070 --> 00:02:05.771
Eddy grinned.

25
00:02:05.772 --> 00:02:19.731
It was the best team ever.
